+# Deploying Level‑4 production wiring (short guide)
+
+This document outlines the minimal ordered steps to bring the Level‑4 features live:
+
+1) Provision KMS + Rekor (Terraform)
+   - Run `terraform init && terraform apply` in terraform/aws to create KMS key and Rekor EC2.
+   - Record COSIGN_KMS_ARN and REKOR_SERVER (http://<rekor-ip>).
+
+2) Configure CI secrets
+   - Set COSIGN_KEY = "kms://<KMS_ARN>" (or cosign-supported URI) and REKOR_SERVER in GitHub Actions secrets.
+   - Verify cosign sign-blob works from a runner with IAM perms (see ops/ci/cosign_aws_setup.sh).
+
+3) Deploy Postgres statefulsets
+   - Apply k8s/postgres/* StatefulSets and create secrets approver-db-secret and qpu-db-secret.
+   - Run migration jobs (migrate-approver-job.yaml & migrate-qpu-job.yaml).
+
+4) Deploy approver service & qpu queue (Postgres-backed)
+   - Deploy approver Postgres-backed container and qpu-queue deployment.
+   - Verify DB records created and approver signing works.
+
+5) Provision HA infra
+   - Install Strimzi operator and apply k8s/infra/strimzi-kafka-cluster.yaml.
+   - Install Redis cluster (Helm) with values in k8s/infra/redis-cluster-values.yaml.
+   - Deploy MLflow + MinIO and ensure persistent storage.
+   - Deploy Trino with metastore.
+
+6) TRT bake fleet
+   - Provision self-hosted GPU runners (use ops/ci/trt_runner_setup.sh).
+   - Run TRT bake CI workflow to produce and sign .plan files.
+
+7) Harden jailed executor & run pentest
+   - Deploy jailed-executor-hardening.yaml and run ops/pentest/run_pentest_checks.sh.
+   - Address any findings and re-run tests.
+
+8) Extended canaries & red-team
+   - Run ops/canary/run_canary.py for 7+ days and use analyze_canary.py + decide_and_rollback.py.
+
+9) Billing & chargeback
+   - Deploy ops/billing/chargeback_uploader.py as CronJob and configure finance endpoint.
+
+10) Backups & rotation
+   - Deploy postgres backup CronJobs using ops/backup scripts and implement kms_rotate workflow.
+
+Contact platform team for assistance and to schedule rollout windows and DR tests.
+
